# Hello

## Metadata

```yaml
format: uimd
format-version: 1
kind: window
status: draft
description: "Hello world UIMD application."
```

## Members

```yaml
headline:
  type: label
  text: "Hello from UIMD"
  description: "Application title."

name:
  type: textinput
  value: ""
  placeholder: "Your name"
  description: "Name to greet."

hello_button:
  type: button
  title: "Say Hello"
  description: "Create the greeting."

quit_button:
  type: button
  title: "Quit"
  description: "Close the application."
```

## Style

```yaml
include: dark
@title:
  background: "#1f2937"
@headline:
  color: "#ffffff"
@quit_button:
  background: "#7f1d1d"
  focus-background: "#dc2626"
```

## User Interface

```ui
+-title-----------------------------------+
| headline............................... |
+-----------------------------------------+
|                                         |
|  "Name"      name....................   |
|                                         |
|  hello_button.......  quit_button.....  |
|                                         |
+-----------------------------------------+
```
